{"4725960": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Lost Skyshard", "steam_appid": 4725960, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>WE IN DISCORD!</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IT IS IN THE DISCORD COMMUNITY THAT YOU CAN QUICKLY CONTRIBUTE TO THE PROJECT!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > This is where our team actively communicates with the community, listens to your ideas, and may implement them in future updates. We are waiting for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to the Archipelago of Winds</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An archipelago where the air is saturated with ancient magic, and the wind itself remembers the voices of carefree citizens. But trouble came from the depths: an unknown force awakened the guardians - soulless robots and brutalized monsters. They took over every piece of land, suppressed the power of the main crystal - Concentrate, and now the region is dying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The brave team of heroes arrived to help, from the region of Light on a flying ship. Their mission is to fight their way through the four zones of the archipelago, reach the central city, and save the Concentrate. Destroy the guardians, restore the balance, and give the wind its freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Character selection and unique playstyle</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character has their own set of abilities and stats, making them unique and with their own playstyle. Each one is eager to help free the region from its troubles and restore its former glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4725960/extras/fe926f3dead1249872c4cb409f2a8496.poster.avif?t=1788266119\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4725960/extras/fe926f3dead1249872c4cb409f2a8496.webm?t=1788266119\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4725960/extras/fe926f3dead1249872c4cb409f2a8496.mp4?t=1788266119\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration of the archipelago</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The entire archipelago consists of a variety of islands of unusual sizes. Each of them is connected by bridges that were built by the locals. The islands can both reward and cause major trouble, as each one is home to people with ill intentions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4725960/extras/ffddcc9728bcc81f26e2288c87fa7391.poster.avif?t=1788266119\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4725960/extras/ffddcc9728bcc81f26e2288c87fa7391.webm?t=1788266119\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4725960/extras/ffddcc9728bcc81f26e2288c87fa7391.mp4?t=1788266119\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Marauders: Monsters and Robots</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ancient technology and the wilderness have come together against the heroes. Each of them has their own approach, and there will be no peaceful solution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4725960/extras/12c7ee437e40f07230065570bafd4355.poster.avif?t=1788266119\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4725960/extras/12c7ee437e40f07230065570bafd4355.webm?t=1788266119\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4725960/extras/12c7ee437e40f07230065570bafd4355.mp4?t=1788266119\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modifiers as the help of heavenly forces</strong><br>he Concentrate itself wants to help the heroes by creating unusual anomalies, creating an unusual tree from the ground that gives extraordinary power that can change the course of battles, causing enemies to drop their weapons in terror and run away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4725960/extras/d26ae2597a99209b573b612aa0b871f7.poster.avif?t=1788266119\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4725960/extras/d26ae2597a99209b573b612aa0b871f7.webm?t=1788266119\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4725960/extras/d26ae2597a99209b573b612aa0b871f7.mp4?t=1788266119\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Go online with your friends!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Defeat the enemy with your friends in a team of up to three people!  It's easier and more fun, especially when your friend dies in a fight with the Guardians!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4725960/extras/199cc0abb4ebde5e94308544a9f9ab75.poster.avif?t=1788266119\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4725960/extras/199cc0abb4ebde5e94308544a9f9ab75.webm?t=1788266119\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"htt